<title>UK: C&amp;W names Yalen chief op officer at C&amp;W Inc.</title>
<headline>C&amp;W names Yalen chief op officer at C&amp;W Inc.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cable &amp; Wireless Plc said on Thursday it had appointed Richard Yalen chief operating officer at its U.S. subsidiary, Cable &amp; Wireless Inc.</p>
<p>Cable &amp; Wireless said Yalen previously was senior vice president marketing and customer satisfaction at Cable &amp; Wireless Inc.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
